# ============================================================
#  Fix 3 (c): recepcion DENTRO del bucle de Choose4Me (bloqueante)
# ============================================================
wait 300
pot 1000
wait 200
tap morse
pot 820
wait 250
expect text Choose4Me
lora rx alfa
lora rx bravo
in 0 morse down
in 120 morse up
run 900
expect serial Guardado: alfa
expect serial Guardado: bravo
print Fix 3: RX DENTRO de Choose4Me verificada
